by check mark whether the registrant is a shell company (as defined in Rule 12b-2 of the Act). Yes &#9744; No <span id="xdx_902_edei--EntityShellCompany_dbF_c20260101__20260630_z3FwBXb7ztWf"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000038" name="dei:EntityShellCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

